      "hash64": "93117F305CF6177F",
      "text": "If there’s any o’ that money I gave ya left, feel\\nfree to keep it as a tip!\\c\\nYou kin even use it to try yer hand at the auction\\nagain if ya like![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
